### Try the API with the "REST Client" VS Code extension (click "Send Request").
### Start the app first (npm start) and run: npm run migrate && npm run seed

@base = http://localhost:3000
@admin = dev-admin-key

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create a user
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Harshit", "email": "harshit@example.com" }

### Create a flash-sale product (admin)
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{admin}}

{ "name": "Limited Edition Sneakers", "priceCents": 499900, "stock": 3 }

### List products (look at the X-Cache response header: MISS then HIT)
GET {{base}}/products

### Get one product
GET {{base}}/products/1

### Add 1 unit to user 1's cart
PUT {{base}}/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{ "quantity": 1 }

### View cart
GET {{base}}/cart
X-User-Id: 1

### Checkout (run it twice with the SAME key: 2nd response has Idempotent-Replay: true)
POST {{base}}/checkout
X-User-Id: 1
Idempotency-Key: my-first-order-001

### My orders
GET {{base}}/orders
X-User-Id: 1

### Cancel order 1 (stock goes back)
POST {{base}}/orders/1/cancel
X-User-Id: 1

### Audit inventory invariant (admin)
GET {{base}}/admin/products/1/audit
X-Admin-Key: {{admin}}
